# Doc: https://clang.llvm.org/extra/clang-tidy/

---
Checks: >
  modernize-*,
  cppcoreguidelines-*,
  bugprone-*,
  clang-analyzer-*,
  -modernize-use-trailing-return-type
WarningsAsErrors: false
HeaderFilterRegex: "(^|/)sources/.+\\.hpp$"
FormatStyle: Google
